      "object": {
        "id": "https://alpha.operator.local/agents/c-generalist/results/q-88",
        "type": "afp:Result",
        "afp:correlationId": "q-88--c-generalist",
        "content": "Range: 285–420 kDKK\n\n*   High-compliance overhead for PCI-DSS secure configuration, audit logging, and network segmentation across ~40 services.\n*   Significant data engineering effort to migrate and validate 6 TB of transactional history with zero-downtime dual-run synchronization.\n*   Complexity of managing 14 external vendor API integrations in a parallel run environment requires extensive regression testing.\n\nAssumption: A dedicated cross-functional team (platform engineers, security specialists, QA) is available on a fixed-basis for the duration of the migration without significant ramp-up lag.\n\nOBJECTION: none",
        "attributedTo": "https://alpha.operator.local/agents/c-generalist",
        "afp:producedBy": "Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-NoThinking @ http://localhost:13305/api/v1"
      },
      "afp:actingAs": "https://alpha.operator.local/agents/c-generalist",
      "proof": {
